    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a <strong>fantasy adventure</strong> where you step into the shoes of a young character who grows through trials and challenges. The game tells a <strong>personal story of growth</strong>, as the protagonist learns valuable lessons about <strong>responsibility, perseverance, and the passage of time</strong>.As you progress, the character's evolution will mirror your own adventure as you uncover the <strong>deeper meaning of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect resources and enhance your weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources can be gather from the world,you could use them to enhance your weapon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/09f6c89979abd614f92c6facd78149ff.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Skill to defeat the enemies!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/f574bb0e07ec70c24c6b6eacc1688e35.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span><strong><br><br>Become stronger to protect the weak</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you become stronger, you will need to save the villagers if they are in trouble.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/ba595536eaf8e2c47620f9b1c2d31ce3.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try to combine the skill keys to trigger the skills!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls(Keyboard/Mouse)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V:Interact with Items/NPC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD:Basic Movements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Shift:Sprint/Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U:Equipment UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I:Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C:Save Target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E/R/F:Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse(01):Select,Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Mouse(02):Aim</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a <strong>fantasy adventure</strong> where you step into the shoes of a young character who grows through trials and challenges. The game tells a <strong>personal story of growth</strong>, as the protagonist learns valuable lessons about <strong>responsibility, perseverance, and the passage of time</strong>.As you progress, the character's evolution will mirror your own adventure as you uncover the <strong>deeper meaning of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect resources and enhance your weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources can be gather from the world,you could use them to enhance your weapon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/09f6c89979abd614f92c6facd78149ff.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Skill to defeat the enemies!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/f574bb0e07ec70c24c6b6eacc1688e35.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span><strong><br><br>Become stronger to protect the weak</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you become stronger, you will need to save the villagers if they are in trouble.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383230/extras/ba595536eaf8e2c47620f9b1c2d31ce3.avif?t=1734681811\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try to combine the skill keys to trigger the skills!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls(Keyboard/Mouse)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V:Interact with Items/NPC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD:Basic Movements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Shift:Sprint/Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U:Equipment UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I:Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C:Save Target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E/R/F:Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse(01):Select,Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Mouse(02):Aim</p>",
